    "physicalNotes": [
      "Seat the LM386N-1 with pin 1 at F11, leaving gain terminals 1 and 8 isolated.",
      "COUT positive connects to pin 5, and CBYP positive connects to pin 7. Connect the speaker off board with insulated wires.",
      "Use a regulated current-limited 9 V supply and grounded zero-offset 80 mV peak input."
    ]
  },
